          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation, from a moving vehicle on a highway, of a reddish-orange elongated shape in the sky that was quickly hidden by a landscape element: probable observation of a colored isolated cloud caused by the rising Sun.",
